      "en": "Codex can help creators and digital publishers build the operational infrastructure behind content: editorial dashboards, structured editors, metadata validators, quality checks, and controlled distribution workflows. The most reliable model is not autonomous publishing, but supervised implementation through GitHub branches, local testing, staging, review, and human approval.",
      "zh": "Codex 可以协助创作者与数字出版团队搭建内容背后的运营基础设施，包括编辑后台、结构化文章编辑器、元数据验证、质量检查与受控分发流程。更可靠的使用方式并非全自动发布，而是通过 GitHub 分支、本地测试、预发布环境、人工审核与最终批准进行受监督的系统建设。"
