      "en": "Mindfulness may influence stress, sleep, inflammation, blood pressure and other processes associated with healthy ageing. But current evidence does not prove that meditation reliably lowers biological age or reverses human ageing. This evidence-aware guide explains what ageing clocks measure, where the science remains uncertain, and how to build a more meaningful personal longevity system.",
