    "excerpt": {
      "en": "Delve into the molecular biology of deep sleep. How aligning your light schedules accelerates the glymphatic flow that sweeps metabolic waste from your neural synapses.",
      "zh": "探究深度睡眠的分子生物学机理。如何通过严苛的暗室管理、核心体温调控，主动加速胶质淋巴系统的液态循环，扫除神经突触间滞留的心智垃圾。"
    },
    "content": {
      "en": "# Circadian Alignment & Glymphatic Cleansing\n\nDuring deep slow-wave sleep (N3), the brain undergoes a radical physical transformation: interstitial space expands by 60%, allowing cerebrospinal fluid (CSF) to flush through brain tissue.\n\nThis is the **glymphatic system** in motion—clearing metabolic byproducts like beta-amyloid and tau proteins that accumulate during waking hours.\n\n## The Three Pillars of Glymphatic Clearance\n\n1. **Core Body Temperature Nadir**: The glymphatic pump relies on a 1–1.5°C drop in core body temperature.\n2. **Light Photobiology**: Morning sunlight exposure (10,000+ lux) pins circadian phase alignment 14–16 hours ahead of melatonin onset.\n3. **Fasting Window**: Abstaining from calories 3 hours prior to sleep reduces autonomic digestive strain, maximizing delta wave amplitude.",
      "zh": "# 昼夜节律重构与胶质淋巴夜间排毒\n\n在深慢波睡眠 (N3) 期间，人类大脑会发生剧烈的物理变化：星形胶质细胞收缩，细胞间隙扩大 60%，允许脑脊液 (CSF) 像清洗液一样高速冲刷脑组织。\n\n这就是**胶质淋巴系统 (Glymphatic System)** 的日常运转——高效清除清醒时产生的β-淀粉样蛋白和 Tau 蛋白等代谢废物。\n\n## 胶质淋巴液洗涤的三大黄金要素\n\n1. **核心体温波谷**：胶质淋巴泵依赖核心体温在夜间下降 1–1.5°C。\n2. **日光光生物学**：晨间 10,000+ 勒克斯的光照刺激，可在 14-16 小时后精准触发褪黑素按时分泌。\n3. **睡前断食窗口**：睡前 3 小时禁食，可减轻消化系统的交感神经负担，显著拉长慢波δ波的持续时间。"
    },
